  "claim": "The last two production rows in Target121 run unit u22106 are one cohesive plugin-prune command graph. Target120 has neither pluginPruneHandler nor a prune command. Target121 imports pluginPruneHandler and createSubcommandRoot together, creates a Root, passes it to the new handler, renders the prune result, waits for exit, and exits. The supplied raw and packaged Target121 source instead imports only pluginPruneHandler, passes options alone, and discards the result. The additional prune registration inserts createSubcommandRoot occurrence 18 and shifts the retained auto-mode critique occurrence from 23 to 24. This bounded replay restores exactly the two missing source files and admits only the pluginPruneHandler row plus that retained ordinal-spill row; it does not override the complete u22106 unit or admit any of its six build-metadata rows.",
